  "description": "When an unexpected accident ends his playing career, football star Go Yoon-Oh returns to his old club as a coach, determined to help them win the title. Then “monster striker” Moon Tae-Won joins the squad. But he fails to live up to the hype, and for some reason, he’s prickly with Yoon-Oh and Yoon-Oh alone. Doing his best to help Tae-Won settle in, Yoon-Oh drops by his place after hearing that he’s unwell. There, a half-asleep Tae-Won turns clingy, insisting that a little physical affection might be just what his game needs. And for a win, Yoon-Oh just might do whatever it takes…\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
